title: room.enter
---
<<if not $sawRoad>>
A cold wind comes down the road.
<<set $sawRoad to true>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
The road runs east, toward the town.
===

title: sign.look
---
The sign reads TOWN, 2 MILES.
===

title: sign.do
---
It's nailed down well.
===

title: traveller.look
---
A traveller with a heavy pack, resting by the road.
===

title: traveller.talk
---
-> Where are you going?
    Traveller: To the town, same as everyone.
    Traveller: There's a fair tomorrow.
-> Was that your lantern on the hill?
    Traveller: I left it burning for whoever came next.
    Hero: That's kind of you.
    <<set $askedLantern to true>>
-> What's at the fair? <<if $askedLantern>>
    Traveller: Lanterns, mostly.
===
